      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program strategy (W3809); partnership cycle
Frequency: Maintained + ongoing
Volume: Vocational/TESDA/SHS partner network
Owner: Trade Capability / TA Marketing
Participants: Trade Capability, TA Marketing (links to VS-121/W3777), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Compliance (links to VS-22), Government Affairs (links to VS-104), Legal (links to VS-100.3)
