      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3825_Task4" name="Trade Capability/TA-Marketing build and manage the vocational/TESDA/senior-high…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade Capability/TA-Marketing build and manage the vocational/TESDA/senior-high partner network: identify and onboard partner schools (near store/DC regions), establish MOAs (links to VS-100.3/W688), align curricula (links to W3810), and engage TESDA regional offices (links to W3811/VS-104)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / TA Marketing / Legal
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3825_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3825_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3825_Task5" name="Trade Capability/Store-Ops run ongoing partner engagement: joint…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Trade Capability/Store-Ops run ongoing partner engagement: joint curriculum/immersion, BuildRight store/DC tours, guest lectures, instructor exchange, scholarship/sponsorship, and partner relationship management
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Store Ops / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3825_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3825_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3825_Task6" name="Trade Capability/Analytics measure partner-network yield (candidates…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Trade Capability/Analytics measure partner-network yield (candidates, OJT-to-hire conversion, partner ROI — links to W3832/W3784) and optimize the partner portfolio
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Analytics
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3825_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3825_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3825_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3825_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
