    <bpmn:process id="W_W3826" name="W3826. Vocational Feeder Pipeline, OJT Placement &amp; School-to-Work Transition" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: School cycle; apprentice intake (W3814)
Frequency: Per cycle (continuous)
Volume: Vocational feeder pipeline
Owner: Trade Capability / TA Marketing / HR
Participants: Trade Capability, TA Marketing (links to VS-121), HR (links to VS-19.1), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Compliance (links to VS-22), Data Privacy (links to VS-91)
Source: workflow W3826 — Vocational Feeder Pipeline, OJT Placement &amp; School-to-Work Transition</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3826_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3826_Lane1" name="Trade Capability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3826_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3826_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3826_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3826_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3826_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3826_Start3" name="School cycle; apprentice intake (W3814)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3826_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3826_Task4" name="Trade Capability/TA-Marketing operate the vocational feeder pipeline: capture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade Capability/TA-Marketing operate the vocational feeder pipeline: capture consented student leads from partners into the talent community (links to VS-121/W3770), nurture with BuildRight trade content, and route qualified candidates to apprentice intake (links to W3814) or direct hire
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / TA Marketing
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3826_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3826_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3826_Task5" name="Trade Capability/HR manage OJT/practicum placement: place partner-school…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Trade Capability/HR manage OJT/practicum placement: place partner-school students into BuildRight OJT slots, supervise and assess per school and BuildRight standards (links to W3819), and capture performance for conversion
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / HR / Store Ops / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3826_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3826_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3826_Task6" name="Trade Capability/HR run school-to-work transition: convert successful OJT…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Trade Capability/HR run school-to-work transition: convert successful OJT students into apprentices (links to W3814) or regular roles (links to W3822), ensure compliant data handling (links to VS-91), and track transition outcomes (links to W3832)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / HR
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3826_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3826_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3826_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3826_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
