        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-600 (ensure controlled execution — Vocational Partnerships, Instructor Pipeline &amp; Trade Capability Analytics (PA-123.3).) | - operational: nurture and transition tracking; operational: RA 10173 governance (links to VS-91)
Owner: Trade Capability / TA Marketing / HR</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
