    <bpmn:process id="W_W3827" name="W3827. Instructor / Master-Trainer Pipeline, Qualification &amp; Development" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program growth (W3809); instructor capacity need
Frequency: Maintained + ongoing
Volume: Instructor/master-trainer pipeline
Owner: Trade Capability / L&amp;D
Participants: Trade Capability, L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), HR (links to VS-19/VS-102), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Master Tradespersons, TESDA (links to W3811)
Source: workflow W3827 — Instructor / Master-Trainer Pipeline, Qualification &amp; Development</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3827_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3827_Lane1" name="Trade Capability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3827_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3827_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3827_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
