    <bpmn:process id="W_W3832" name="W3832. Trade-Capability Analytics, ROI &amp; Program Effectiveness Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporting cycle; executive review
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Program analytics &amp; ROI
Owner: Trade Capability / Analytics
Participants: Trade Capability, Analytics (links to VS-28.1), People Analytics (links to VS-103.3), Finance (links to VS-17.4), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Store Ops (links to VS-07), In-Store Services (links to VS-09), CHRO
Source: workflow W3832 — Trade-Capability Analytics, ROI &amp; Program Effectiveness Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3832_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3832_Lane1" name="Trade Capability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3832_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3832_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3832_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3832_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3832_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3832_Start3" name="Reporting cycle; executive review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3832_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3832_Task4" name="Trade Capability/Analytics measure program effectiveness: intake → completion →…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade Capability/Analytics measure program effectiveness: intake → completion → certification → placement → retention, apprentice quality/performance vs external hires, certification rates, and time-to-productivity
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Analytics
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3832_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3832_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3832_Task5" name="Trade Capability/Finance measure program ROI: cost per certified apprentice…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Trade Capability/Finance measure program ROI: cost per certified apprentice (links to W3812), productivity/service-quality/attach uplift (links to VS-124), service-revenue contribution (links to VS-09/VS-12), and reduced external-hire/training cost
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Finance / Analytics
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead / CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3832_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3832_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3832_Task6" name="Trade Capability/CHRO report trade-capability and program ROI to executive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Trade Capability/CHRO report trade-capability and program ROI to executive (links to VS-33.2/VS-36) and the board talent/sustainability lens (links to VS-25.3), and translate into program/budget actions (links to W3809/W3812)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / CHRO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3832_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3832_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3832_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3832_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3832_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-600 (ensure controlled execution — Vocational Partnerships, Instructor Pipeline &amp; Trade Capability Analytics (PA-123.3).) | - operational: ROI analytics; operational: effectiveness metrics
Owner: Trade Capability / Analytics</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
